## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Dear Buyer,\n\nThank you for your inquiry about our 4.5L Digital Air Fryer (model AF-45D, 120V 60Hz, 1400W).\n\nCertifications:\nWe do not currently hold ETL or an FCC SDoC test report for this model. We also do not have UL. What we have now is a CB report (IEC 60335-2-9) and CE (LVD/EMC). We can check with our team whether ETL and FCC testing could be arranged for this model. However, the cost and timing need to be confirmed first, and testing would add time before shipment. If these certificates are a must for your market, please let us know and we will come back to you with a realistic plan.\n\nBasket coating:\nThe current basket has a PTFE non-stick coating, so it is not PTFE-free. For PFOA, we only have a declaration from our coating supplier, not a third-party test report. We are checking internally whether a different basket option is possible and will update you. We cannot confirm it at this stage.\n\nPrice and MOQ (FOB Ningbo):\n- MOQ: 1,000 units\n- 1,000 to 2,999 units: USD 24.50 per unit\n- 3,000 units and above: USD 22.80 per unit\n\nWe understand your target is USD 20.00 FOB. That is below our lowest price tier, so we are not able to accept it. If you can move to 1,000 units, the USD 24.50 price applies. At that quantity, printing your logo on the color box is also free (we would need your vector artwork).\n\nLead time:\nOur standard lead time is 35 days after deposit and artwork confirmation, so 30 days is not possible for us. If ETL/FCC testing is required, the schedule would be longer.\n\nPayment terms:\n30% T/T deposit and 70% against B/L copy, or L/C at sight.\n\nPackaging:\nColor box, 2 units per carton.\n\nNext steps:\n1. Samples: We can send a sample, charged at the unit price, with international freight paid by you. The sample cost will be deducted from your mass-production order.\n2. Video factory audit: We can arrange a video call here on Alibaba to show you our production line.\n\nCould you tell us whether ETL/FCC is mandatory for your sales channel, and whether 1,000 units works for you? We will then prepare the next steps accordingly.\n\nBest regards,\nSales Team\nYongjiang Small Appliances"
}
